    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u201cWhen you\u2019re finally there for yourself\u2026 will you be able to shoulder it?\u201d</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Self-Indulgence</strong> is a PSX-style psychological horror game that drags you deep into a decaying world where memories rot and truth is a shifting shadow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guided only by fading memories and desperation, a father searches for his missing child\u2014only to uncover something far more disturbing than he ever imagined. What begins as a rescue turns into a descent into the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd38 <strong>Retro survival horror, reimagined</strong> \u2013 tank controls, fixed camera angles, gritty textures<br>\ud83d\udd38 <strong>A story-driven nightmare</strong> \u2013 every clue pulls you deeper<br>\ud83d\udd38 <strong>2 major free updates coming post-launch</strong><br>\ud83d\udd38 <strong>No jumpscares. Just dread.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you loved the eerie silence of <i>Silent Hill</i>, the tension of <i>Resident Evil</i>, and the mystery of <i>Lost</i>, you\u2019re going to feel right at home\u2014and very, very uncomfortable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are you ready to remember what you\u2019ve tried to forget?</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u201cWhen you\u2019re finally there for yourself\u2026 will you be able to shoulder it?\u201d</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Self-Indulgence</strong> is a PSX-style psychological horror game that drags you deep into a decaying world where memories rot and truth is a shifting shadow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guided only by fading memories and desperation, a father searches for his missing child\u2014only to uncover something far more disturbing than he ever imagined. What begins as a rescue turns into a descent into the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd38 <strong>Retro survival horror, reimagined</strong> \u2013 tank controls, fixed camera angles, gritty textures<br>\ud83d\udd38 <strong>A story-driven nightmare</strong> \u2013 every clue pulls you deeper<br>\ud83d\udd38 <strong>2 major free updates coming post-launch</strong><br>\ud83d\udd38 <strong>No jumpscares. Just dread.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you loved the eerie silence of <i>Silent Hill</i>, the tension of <i>Resident Evil</i>, and the mystery of <i>Lost</i>, you\u2019re going to feel right at home\u2014and very, very uncomfortable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are you ready to remember what you\u2019ve tried to forget?</strong></p>",
